"**Russell Group universities that appear in the top\u202f10 of all three 2023 Times Higher Education subject rankings**  \n\n| University | Clinical & Health (Top\u202f10) | Arts & Humanities (Top\u202f10) | Psychology (Top\u202f10) |\n|------------|---------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------|\n| **University of Cambridge** | Rank\u202f2 \u2013 \u201cUniversity\u202fof\u202fCambridge\u201d\u3010web_search 1\u2020source=5\u2020chunk=0\u202648\u3011 | Rank\u202f3 \u2013 \u201cUniversity\u202fof\u202fCambridge\u201d\u3010web_search 2\u2020source=1\u2020chunk=0\u202654\u3011 | Rank\u202f2 \u2013 \u201cUniversity\u202fof\u202fCambridge\u201d\u3010web_search 3\u2020source=1\u2020chunk=0\u202660\u3011 |\n| **University College London (UCL)** | Rank\u202f8 \u2013 \u201cUCL\u201d\u3010web_search 1\u2020source=5\u2020chunk=0\u202638\u3011 | Rank\u202f6 \u2013 \u201cUCL\u201d\u3010web_search 2\u2020source=1\u2020chunk=0\u202666\u3011 | Rank\u202f4 \u2013 \u201cUCL\u201d\u3010web_search 3\u2020source=1\u2020chunk=0\u202668\u3011 |\n\n**Answer**\n\n*University of Cambridge* and *University College London (UCL)* are the only Russell Group universities that are ranked within the top\u202f10 for *Clinical & Health*, *Arts & Humanities*, and *Psychology* in the 2023 Times Higher Education subject rankings."